Both were n_tokens batched tiny GEMMs (rel table 1024x24x16, mix 2304x1xB), which hipBLASLt runs with
the GPU mostly idle (pp2048 767 t/s by default, 1257 with ROCBLAS_USE_HIPBLASLT_BATCHED=0).
- rel table: one GEMM over all heads and tokens (same bias matrix), Rcur flattened to 2D.
- depth mix with one query: sum over blocks as a broadcast multiply and a row sum.
